@startuml activity-process-order
' Process order: the admin confirms an order, ships it with GHN or cancels it.
' Order: Pending -> Confirmed -> Completed, or Cancelled before it leaves.
' Shipping: Pending -> Shipping -> Delivered or Returned, reported by GHN
' (activity 20, Update shipping status).

title Process order

|Admin|
|Coffee Shop System|
|GHN|
|Payment gateway|
|Email service|

|Admin|
start
:1 · Open Manage Orders;
|Coffee Shop System|
:Show the orders;
|Admin|
:2 · Open an order;
|Coffee Shop System|
:Load the order;
:Show the order details;
|Admin|
switch (What next?)
case ([done])
  stop
case ([confirm])
  :3 · Click Confirm\n(Pending order);
  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Set the order Confirmed;
  |Email service|
  :Email the customer\n(order confirmed);
  stop
case ([ship])
  |Admin|
  :4 · Click Ship with GHN\n(Confirmed order);
  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Send the shipment to GHN\n(address, items, COD amount);
  |GHN|
  :Create the shipment\n(returns the tracking code);
  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Save the tracking number;
  |Email service|
  :Email the customer\n(tracking number);
  stop
case ([cancel])
  |Admin|
  :5 · Click Cancel order, then confirm;
  |Coffee Shop System|
  if (Not left with GHN?) then ([no])
    :Show "Not allowed";
    stop
  else ([yes])
  endif
  if (Shipment created?) then ([yes])
    |GHN|
    :Cancel the shipment;
  else ([no])
  endif
  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Set the order Cancelled\n(items back in stock);
  if (Paid online?) then ([yes])
    |Payment gateway|
    :Refund the payment;
  else ([no])
  endif
  |Email service|
  :Email the customer\n(order cancelled);
  stop
endswitch

@enduml
